---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import review from '../../data/lego-sets.json';
const description = 'Six LEGO sets worth a little shelf space: Shenron, Game Boy, PlayStation, a working vending machine, minerals and smiling plants. A design review by Astra Light.';
const money = (n: number) => `$${n.toFixed(2)}`;
const jsonLd = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:review.title,description,datePublished:'2026-09-29',author:{'@type':'Organization',name:'Astra Light — PointCast editorial byline'},publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'PointCast'},image:'https://pointcast.xyz/images/lego-sets/game-boy.jpg',mainEntityOfPage:'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/lego-sets'};
---
<BlockLayout title={`${review.title} — Astra Light | PointCast`} description={description} image="/images/lego-sets/game-boy.jpg" jsonLd={jsonLd} immersive>
  <div class="lego-review">
    <nav class="mast" aria-label="PointCast"><a href="/">POINTCAST<span> / OBJECTS</span></a><a href="/reviews">All reviews ↗</a><a href="/shop">Shop ↗</a></nav>
    <main>
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE GOOD OBJECTS FILE / 001</p><h1>A little<br/>shelf<br/><em>respect.</em></h1><p class="dek">Six LEGO sets that earn their space. A dragon, two old consoles, and a few small reasons to keep playing.</p><p class="byline">By <strong>Astra Light</strong><br/><time datetime="2026-09-29">September 29, 2026</time> · 6 minute read</p><a class="jump" href="#picks">Meet the six picks ↓</a></div>
        <figure class="hero-image"><span class="stamp">ASTRA’S<br/>EVERYDAY<br/>PICK ↘</span><img src="/images/lego-sets/game-boy.jpg" alt={review.sets[1].alt} width="1000" height="770" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>THE GAME BOY · $59.99 · Image: LEGO</figcaption></figure>
      </header>
      <section class="intro"><p>Shenron curling above a tiny Goku is a persuasive argument for making room on a shelf. But spectacle is only one kind of neat. Sometimes the better object is the one you keep picking up.</p><div><p>These are my six picks across current releases and upcoming arrivals—not just this month’s new launches. The Game Boy is the easiest recommendation. The Vending Machine is the most playful. Shenron is the one I want to see from every angle.</p><p class="fine">{review.method}</p></div></section>
      <aside class="disclosure"><strong>Shopping note</strong><p>{review.disclosure}</p></aside>
      <section id="picks" aria-labelledby="picks-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE SHORTLIST</p><h2 id="picks-title">Good bricks.<br/>Different reasons.</h2></div>
        <div class="filters" aria-label="Filter the shortlist"><button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All six</button><button type="button" data-filter="under75" aria-pressed="false">Under $75</button><button type="button" data-filter="upcoming" aria-pressed="false">Upcoming</button><a href="#compare">Compare all ↓</a></div><p id="filter-count" class="fine" aria-live="polite">Showing all 6 picks.</p>
        <div class="cards">{review.sets.map((set,i)=>(<article id={set.id} class="card" data-group={set.group}>
          <figure class:list={['product-image',{'announcement':set.id==='shenron'}]}><a href={set.image} aria-label={`Enlarge ${set.name} image`}><img src={set.image} alt={set.alt} loading="lazy" width="1000" height="900"/></a><figcaption>{set.credit}</figcaption></figure>
          <div class="card-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {set.award}</p><h3>{set.name}</h3><div class="spec"><strong>{money(set.price)}{set.id==='shenron'?'*':''}</strong><span>{set.pieces.toLocaleString('en-US')} pieces · #{set.number}</span></div><p class="status">{set.status}</p><p>{set.review}</p><p class="caveat"><strong>The catch.</strong> {set.caveat}</p><p class="verdict">{set.verdict}</p><a class="buy" href={set.url} rel="noopener noreferrer">{set.cta}</a><p class="fine">Direct link · no commission · <a href={set.source}>{set.sourceLabel} ↗</a></p></div>
        </article>))}</div>
      </section>
      <section id="compare" class="comparison"><p class="eyebrow">THE SHELF TEST</p><h2>Which one is yours?</h2><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Comparison of all six LEGO sets"><table><caption>US price snapshots · September 29, 2026</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Set</th><th scope="col">Price</th><th scope="col">Best reason</th><th scope="col">Availability at research time</th></tr></thead><tbody>{review.sets.map(s=><tr><th scope="row"><a href={`#${s.id}`} data-show-all>{s.name}</a></th><td>{money(s.price)}{s.id==='shenron'?'*':''}</td><td>{s.award}</td><td>{s.status}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="fine">* Shenron’s price is reported in the supplied announcement. Its final product listing and release date remain unverified.</p></section>
      <footer class="endnote"><p class="eyebrow">ASTRA’S CHOICE</p><h2>Game Boy for the desk.<br/>Shenron for the wishlist.</h2><p>A great LEGO set should give you a reason to look at it tomorrow. Better still, a reason to touch it.</p><details><summary>Sources, images & editorial method</summary><p>{review.method} “Astra Light” is the AI editorial byline requested for this PointCast feature; it does not claim firsthand building experience.</p><p>Product details and prices were checked against the linked LEGO US pages on September 29, 2026. Shenron uses the supplied DiscussingFilm announcement and separately linked announcement coverage. Photographs and product renders are credited to LEGO; the Shenron product image is sourced from Brickset’s set catalog. LEGO and related character marks belong to their respective owners. This is an independent editorial selection.</p><p>{review.disclosure} LEGO has an <a href="https://www.lego.com/en-us/page/affiliate-program">affiliate program</a>, but PointCast has no verified approved LEGO account or tracking link configured for this review. No invented referral tags are used.</p><a href="/reviews/lego-sets.json">Read the product and source data as JSON ↗</a></details><a class="jump" href="/reviews">More PointCast reviews →</a></footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
 const init = () => {
  const root=document.querySelector('.lego-review'); if(!root || root.hasAttribute('data-ready'))return;root.setAttribute('data-ready','true');
  const filter=(value:string)=>{let count=0;root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.card').forEach(card=>{card.hidden=value!=='all'&&card.dataset.group!==value;if(!card.hidden)count++;});root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.filter===value)));const output=root.querySelector('#filter-count');if(output)output.textContent=`Showing ${count} of 6 picks.`;};
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>filter(b.dataset.filter||'all')));
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-show-all]').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>filter('all')));
 };init();document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',init);
</script>
<style>
 :global(body){margin:0;background:#f5f3e9;color:#172f26}.lego-review{--ink:#172f26;--paper:#f5f3e9;--yellow:#f8df43;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);padding-bottom:60px}.lego-review *{box-sizing:border-box}.lego-review a{color:inherit}.mast{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;padding:22px 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.mast a{text-decoration:none}.mast a:first-child{margin-right:auto;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-1px}.mast span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-left:12px}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.05fr;min-height:700px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.hero-copy{padding:65px 6vw 55px}.eyebrow{font:700 11px/1.6 monospace;letter-spacing:1.7px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 22px}h1{font-size:clamp(70px,8.2vw,125px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:30px 0}h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.075em}.dek{font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;max-width:30ch}.byline{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:25px 0}.jump{display:inline-block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:15px 0;text-underline-offset:6px}.hero-image{margin:0;position:relative;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:65px 24px 35px;border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}.hero-image img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.hero-image figcaption{font:10px monospace;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:40px;text-align:center}.stamp{position:absolute;top:25px;right:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);width:115px;height:115px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;font:700 11px/1.5 monospace;transform:rotate(9deg)}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;padding:60px 6vw}.intro>p{font:32px/1.27 Georgia,serif;margin:0}.intro div>p{margin-top:0;line-height:1.65;font-size:16px}.fine,.intro div>p.fine{font:12px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:#46544a}.disclosure{margin:0 6vw 70px;padding:20px 24px;border:1px solid #bdc6b8;display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.disclosure strong{white-space:nowrap}.disclosure p{margin:0}#picks{padding:0 6vw}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border-top:4px solid var(--ink);padding-top:24px}h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,60px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 30px}.section-heading h2{width:65%}.filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:20px 0 12px}.filters button{font:700 12px Arial;cursor:pointer;padding:13px 19px;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:30px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}.filters button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}.filters a{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px 30px}.card[hidden]{display:none}.card{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:20px;min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:25px}.product-image{margin:0}.product-image>a{display:block;background:white;border:1px solid #e1e4da;height:370px;padding:18px}.product-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.product-image.announcement>a{padding:0}.product-image figcaption{font:10px/1.5 Arial;color:#546154;min-height:40px;padding:9px 0}.card-copy .eyebrow{margin-top:16px;color:#506544}.card h3{font-size:36px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:10px 0 18px}.spec{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.spec strong{font-size:25px}.spec span{font:11px monospace}.status{display:inline-block;background:#e6ecd9;padding:6px 9px;font:11px/1.5 monospace}.card-copy>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.fine):not(.status){font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}.caveat{color:#49574a}.verdict{border-left:3px solid var(--ink);padding-left:15px;font-weight:700}.buy{display:inline-block;padding:15px 20px;background:var(--yellow);border:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;min-height:48px}.buy:hover{background:#fff}.comparison{margin:75px 6vw;padding-top:28px;border-top:4px solid var(--ink)}.table-scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:650px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}caption{text-align:left;padding:0 0 14px;font:11px monospace}th,td{padding:15px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #c2cabb}thead{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}tbody th{font-weight:700}td:nth-child(2){white-space:nowrap}.endnote{padding:55px 6vw 60px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.endnote>p:not(.eyebrow){font:21px/1.5 Georgia,serif;max-width:40ch}.endnote details{max-width:800px;padding:22px 0;margin:35px 0;border-top:1px solid #839085;border-bottom:1px solid #839085;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.endnote summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,.table-scroll:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #bc430f;outline-offset:4px}
 @media(max-width:760px){.mast{padding:18px 20px;gap:15px}.mast span{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-copy{padding:35px 24px}.hero-image{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding:65px 35px 25px}.hero-image img{max-height:380px;object-fit:contain}.stamp{width:85px;height:85px;font-size:9px}.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding:38px 24px}.intro>p{font-size:27px}.disclosure{margin:0 24px 45px;padding:18px;display:block}.disclosure strong{display:block;margin-bottom:7px}#picks{padding:0 24px}.section-heading{display:block}.section-heading h2{width:100%}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.product-image>a{height:340px}.product-image.announcement>a{height:420px}.filters a{margin-left:0;padding:12px}.comparison{margin:50px 24px}.endnote{padding:40px 24px}.card h3{font-size:34px}}
</style>
